#: ../../index.md:52 678741e26a404f7d84a8f154614b1956
msgid "🔥 Motivation"
msgstr "🔥 为什么开发 Bookshelf？"

#: ../../index.md:54 61f9e8993a374b1887e18311c8e37f05
msgid "Libraries save time and make systems easier to create. But many Minecraft mapmakers aren't used to them. Bookshelf exists to change that. Bookshelf focuses on ease of use. Each module is simple, works for any skill level, and keeps performance in mind."
msgstr "库可以节省时间并使系统更易于创建。但许多 Minecraft 地图制作者不习惯使用它们。Bookshelf 的存在就是为了改变这一点。Bookshelf 专注于易用性。每个模块都很简单，适用于任何技能水平，并注重性能。"

#: ../../index.md:58 61bad861bbb54689a72769cb83cfc6d7
msgid "\"I have seen further than others because I have stood on the shoulders of giants.\""
msgstr "“如果说我看得比别人更远些，那是因为我站在巨人的肩膀上。”"

#: ../../index.md:59 3ababb2216fd4d58a84f5ef3830d69d0
